Subject: [PATCH 309/333] [ae-patch] Give the sidebar's Admin Center and
 Session Dashboard count pills one size and one set of colours

The Admin Center's Needs you pill used text-10, a size this theme does not define, so its 13 px text sat off centre in a 16 px pill, and its review count wore the selected row's pink; the Session Dashboard's slots pill drew 11.7 px semibold text in a 19 px pill. Both now share aeCountPill.ts: the slots pill's size with the text centred, red tint for something to act on now (an urgent item, slots over the limit), grey tint for a plain count.
