 web/src/components/AeSlotsPill.tsx           |  6 ++----
 web/src/lib/aeCountPill.ts                   | 13 +++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 web/src/lib/aeCountPill.ts

